  "notes": [
    "The Tibetan alphabet for SquirrelGo Alphabets. Romanization is Wylie, which follows the spelling; the hints and IPA give the Lhasa pronunciation, with á for a high tone and à for a low one. eSpeak NG has no Tibetan voice, so the sounds are made from the IPA (without tones). Hints, groupings and articles are original."
